&lt;section&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;tangerine&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;font-size:4em;padding:1.2rem 0px;&quot;&gt;Impeach. Convict. Remove.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Recap of this week in the revolution: Trump regime to deport legal immigrants and Trump launches another trade war with Canada. Trump regime&amp;#39;s plans to meddle in midterms. Idiot-in-chief wants to rename Lake Ontario to Lake America.&lt;/p&gt;
