&lt;h4&gt;The ugly...&lt;/h4&gt;
		&lt;div class=&quot;blob&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        Trump brings national debt to new record: $40 trillion &lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/treasury-national-debt-limit-a27a8d3651ff810b25c610d3e1b6259d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/3gD1yb-PpF-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;National Debt: 2006-2026&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/3gD1yb-PpF-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;336&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/3gD1yb-PpF-200.webp 200w, /images/3gD1yb-PpF-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

        &lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;In less than two years in office, Donny 2-Dolls has added over $4 trillion to the U.S. national debt, bringing the total to a new all-time high of $40 trillion. Despite a promise to reign in government spending and the disastrous work of DOGE, the Trump regime has driven the national debt to an all-time high. &lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;If you think times are tough now, they are only getting worse as Trump and his army of incompetents continue to drive up the debt. The more we borrow, the more we have to pay in interest, which means that with every passing year, we have less tax revenue available to spend because we are spending more and more money on interest payments on our debts.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Currently, the U.S. has the worst fiscal position of all developed countries, according to the Organization for Economic Co-operation and Development.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related Links:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/treasury-national-debt-limit-a27a8d3651ff810b25c610d3e1b6259d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(AP) The US national debt now stands at $40 trillion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr style=&quot;clear:both&quot;/&gt;
	&lt;div class=&quot;blob&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
