&lt;section class=&quot;block the-good&quot;&gt;
	&lt;h4&gt;The good...&lt;/h4&gt;
	&lt;div class=&quot;blob&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        Lying Leavitt will leave the Trump regime &lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/trump-press-secretary-leavitt-dc3753a957b05ef554bf277221d9cf46&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The Trump regime&#39;s Minister of Propaganda, Karo-lyin&#39; Leavitt, is stepping down from her duties of berating the press for questioning the regime and blatantly lying to the American public. She will not be missed.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The clip below comes from the 1984 television mini-series &lt;i&gt;V: The Final Battle,&lt;/i&gt;. In this scene, the press secretary for the fascist alien regime that has taken over the Earth is called out for propagating lies to hide the true nature of the regime from the public. These words are as fitting for Leavitt today as they were for the fictional Kristine Walsh in the mini-series. Watch the full clip to learn the fate of those who dare to challenge the power of the regime.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;I&#39;ll tell you what is untrue: It is untrue that you are working for a benevolent regime. It is untrue that you are an impartial journalist. What&#39;s true is that fascists have taken over our planet and you&#39;re their minister of propaganda.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a discredit to your profession. You&#39;ve allowed personal ambition to corrupt your integrity and you no longer have credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;figcaption class=&quot;blockquote-footer&quot;&gt;Doctor Corley Walker (played by Don Starr) confronts the Visitors&#39; press secretary, Kristine Walsh (played by Jenny Sullivan)&lt;/figcaption&gt;
		&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;
			&lt;iframe width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DTfJZhg3RK4?si=OENgavCZEZho6NKP&amp;amp;start=9&quot; title=&quot;YouTube video player&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allow=&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot; allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related Links:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/trump-press-secretary-leavitt-dc3753a957b05ef554bf277221d9cf46&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(AP) White House press secretary Karoline Leavitt is leaving the Trump administration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
