    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/duaFQwanvT-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;Abdul El-Sayed, 2024&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/duaFQwanvT-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;532&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/duaFQwanvT-200.webp 200w, /images/duaFQwanvT-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Abdul El-Sayed, 2024.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Abdul El-Sayed just won the Democratic primary to be the party&#39;s candidate for an open U.S. Senate seat representing Michigan. El-Sayed is a progressive Democrat, and more importantly, he&#39;s willing to stand up and fight the corruption in the current regime. El-Sayed is representative of a new wave of Democratic candidates winning the hearts and minds of the people around the country. These new Democrats are challenging the status quo and are willing to actually stand up for what they believe in, and voters are taking notice.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Across the country, voters are looking for candidates who won&#39;t buckle under the Trump regime&#39;s unending string of abuses of our political and legal system. Americans are not becoming more &quot;leftist,&quot; but they are waking up to the reality that the Republican Party&#39;s corruption and tyranny have no place in the United States of America.&lt;/p&gt;
