    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        ICE murder spree continues. Latest victim in Maine &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnn.com/2026/07/13/us/live-news/maine-ice-shooting-houston-minnesota&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/eqGN2G_bKz-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;Abolir la Migra&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/eqGN2G_bKz-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;799&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/eqGN2G_bKz-200.webp 200w, /images/eqGN2G_bKz-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Protestor holding a sign reading &quot;Abolir la Migra&quot; (Abolish the Border Patrol) in a February anti-ICE demonstration.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;ICE agents shot and killed Joan Sebastian Guerrero, who was not the target of their operation, right in front of his family as he was heading to work. Guerrero is originally from Columbia, but is in the United States legally and has a social security number. Social Security numbers are issued to citizens and also to people who are legally allowed to live and work in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;David Brouillette is the agent who murdered Guerrero. According to his ex-wife and several close relatives, Brouillette has a history of serious mental health issues and has no businesses carrying a gun and a badge.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;This is at least the tenth person shot by federal agents since Donny 2-Dolls began his second term in office last year.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
