    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        Lindsey Graham dies unexpectedly &lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/lindsey-graham-dies-south-carolina-bfa556e170f2df22ce9ffc7165da3dfa&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/jbV5hXVlVQ-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;Lindsey Graham and Donald Trump&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/jbV5hXVlVQ-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;533&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/jbV5hXVlVQ-200.webp 200w, /images/jbV5hXVlVQ-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lindsey Graham and Donny 2-Dolls.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Senator Lindsey Graham died unexpectedly earlier this week after a &quot;brief and sudden illness.&quot; Later examination showed the cause of death to be a tear in his aorta related to hardening of his arteries. Graham is best known for his total reversal of positions on Trump. In 2015, he summarized his views of Trump by saying, &quot;He&#39;s a race-baiting, xenophobic, religious bigot. He doesn&#39;t represent my party.&quot; By 2026, his assessment of Trump had changed to, &quot;Mr. President, you&#39;re not far behind God.&quot; Such a complete reversal of stance is more than just changing positions on a subject when new facts emerge. Graham was once one of the most vocal opponents of Trump, but as soon as Trump won the 2016 election, Graham spent the next decade worming his way into the president&#39;s good graces with sycophantic expressions of flattery in order to protect his own career as a Senator at the expense of his consituents and the American people. Graham briefly tried to disassociate himself from Trump after the January 6th insurrection, but as soon as he saw that Trump would not be held accountable for his participation in the assault on the capital, he went right back to sucking up to Trump.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Graham was a hawk when it came to foreign policy, cheering on Israel&#39;s genocide in Gaza and celebrating Trump&#39;s war with Iran. Graham was instrumental in bypassing the normal legislative process to push through controversial legislation to pass significant Republican policies without allowing the Democrats to filibuster. He did break with some of the Party&#39;s positions by arguing for the need for a valid path to citizenship for immigrants. He also supported Ukraine&#39;s efforts to defend itself against Russian aggression, leading some to suspect that Graham&#39;s death might have been an assassination by Russian agents. Graham&#39;s Senate seat will be filled by his sister, Darline Graham, who was appointed to fill the position by the governor of South Carolina in accordance with state law. Darline has no political experience, having worked as an optician and having received a master&#39;s degree in rehabilitation counseling. A special election will be held next month to find a replacement for Graham on the November 2026 ballot to take over his seat in January.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related Links:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;
