			&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/iran-us-israel-war-hormuz-strait-june-28-2026-1132d316545db2cddb3928b6e7840f51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;U.S. and Iran continue to exchange fire despite ceasefire MOU&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;			
