				&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WWtt_2wrJ5w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(YouTube-The Resistance) Not in the mood to celebrate | Anti-Trump protest song | 250th Anniversary&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
