&lt;section&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;tangerine&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;font-size:4em;padding:1.2rem 0px;&quot;&gt;Impeach. Convict. Remove.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Recap of this week in the revolution: Video game mocks Trump regime. Polluters exempted from Clean Air Act and conservation no longer valid use of public lands. Trump wants to pay January 6 insurrectionists.&lt;/p&gt;
