				&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/redistricting-congress-voting-rights-trump-1ed6f8c68884b372efca79fbb50e343a&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(AP) Trump&#39;s redistricting push fizzles in South Carolina Senate but wins in Missouri&#39;s top court&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
